# Sarthak Salvi Portfolio — Contact Form Integration
#
# 1. Google Apps Script Web App Deployment URL:
# Deploy your Google Apps Script (from google-apps-script/Code.gs) as a Web App:
# - Execute as: Me
# - Who has access: Anyone
# Paste the resulting Web App URL here:
VITE_GOOGLE_SCRIPT_URL=https://script.google.com/macros/s/YOUR_DEPLOYMENT_ID/exec

# Optional: Local Dev Gemini API Key (only needed if testing Gemini directly through Vite dev proxy)
# In production, the Gemini API key is stored SECURELY in Google Apps Script properties, NEVER in frontend code!
# GEMINI_API_KEY=AIzaSy...
